え、これ踊るの難しかった！
Eh, dancing this was hard!

541
00:43:14,332 --> 00:43:17,032
あ、りじょ
Ah, little by little...

542
00:43:17,132 --> 00:43:20,032
Do it, do it, えい、や、や！
Do it, do it, ei, ya, ya!

543
